@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Cadastro (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "igor@exemplo.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Cadastro duplicado com o e-mail em maiúsculas (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "IGOR@EXEMPLO.COM",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Cadastro inválido (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "email-invalido",
  "password": "123"
}

### 4. Login (200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "igor@exemplo.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken); client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.refreshToken); %}

### 5. Login com senha errada (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "igor@exemplo.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 6. GET /api/v1/users/me com token (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. GET /api/v1/users/me sem token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me

### 8. Refresh (200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken); client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.refreshToken); %}

### 9. Logout (204 No Content)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 10. Refresh com o token que acabou de ser revogado (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 11. Upload de documento → 202
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="regulamento.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./samples/regulamento.pdf
--boundary--

> {% client.global.set("documentId", response.body.id); %}

### 12. Consultar status de processamento do documento → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 13. Listar todos os documentos do usuário autenticado → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. Chat sobre o documento → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Quais são as regras para resgate e existe carência?", "documentId": "{{documentId}}" }

### 15. Pergunta fora do documento → deve dizer que o documento não traz a informação
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Qual é a previsão da taxa Selic para o ano que vem?", "documentId": "{{documentId}}" }
